<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Adewumi Project — Backend Engineer</title>
<meta name="description" content="Adewumi Project builds REST/GraphQL APIs, database architecture, and authentication systems for startups and teams.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#ECEEE7;
    --panel:#F6F7F1;
    --ink:#172018;
    --muted:#54604F;
    --line:#C9CDBA;
    --teal:#2E6E5E;
    --amber:#B97A32;
    --term-bg:#12231C;
    --term-key:#E3A458;
    --term-str:#9FE0C0;
    --term-punc:#7C9488;
    --focus:#2E6E5E;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  a{color:inherit;}
  h1,h2,h3{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    margin:0;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset:3px;}
  .wrap{max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 28px;}

  /* header */
  header{
    padding:26px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  header .wrap{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;}
  .logo{font-size:19px; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:8px;}
  .logo .dot{color:var(--teal); font-size:22px; line-height:0;}
  nav{display:flex; gap:28px; align-items:center;}
  nav a{font-size:15px; text-decoration:none; color:var(--muted); font-weight:500;}
  nav a:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  .btn{
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:15px;
    padding:11px 20px;
    border-radius:5px;
    text-decoration:none;
    display:inline-block;
    border:1px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .btn-solid{background:var(--ink); color:var(--bg);}
  .btn-solid:hover{background:#2b3a2c;}
  .btn-ghost{border-color:var(--line); color:var(--ink);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--ink);}

  /* hero */
  .hero{padding:76px 0 88px;}
  .hero .wrap{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr; gap:56px; align-items:center;}
  .hero h1{font-size:44px; line-height:1.12;}
  .hero p.lead{font-size:18px; color:var(--muted); max-width:46ch; margin:20px 0 30px;}
  .hero .ctas{display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .term{
    background:var(--term-bg);
    border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 18px 40px -18px rgba(10,20,14,0.45);
  }
  .term-bar{
    display:flex; gap:7px;
    padding:13px 16px;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .term-bar span{width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.18);}
  .term-body{padding:22px 24px 26px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.7;}
  .term-body .k{color:var(--term-key);}
  .term-body .s{color:var(--term-str);}
  .term-body .p{color:var(--term-punc);}

  section{padding:64px 0;}
  section h2{font-size:28px; margin-bottom:8px;}
  section .section-sub{color:var(--muted); font-size:16px; max-width:56ch; margin:0 0 34px;}

  /* services as endpoints */
  .endpoint{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:96px 1fr;
    gap:22px;
    padding:22px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    align-items:start;
  }
  .endpoint:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .method{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:13px;
    padding:5px 9px;
    border-radius:4px;
    width:fit-content;
    height:fit-content;
  }
  .m-get{background:rgba(46,110,94,0.13); color:var(--teal);}
  .m-post{background:rgba(185,122,50,0.15); color:var(--amber);}
  .m-put{background:rgba(23,32,24,0.08); color:var(--ink);}
  .endpoint h3{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .endpoint p{margin:0; color:var(--muted); font-size:15.5px;}

  /* work */
  .work-item{
    padding:26px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .work-item:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .work-item h3{font-size:20px; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .work-item p{margin:0 0 12px; color:var(--muted); max-width:64ch;}
  .stack{display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .stack span{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--muted);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:4px;
    padding:4px 8px;
  }

  /* contact */
  .contact-box{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:44px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:24px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .contact-box h2{font-size:26px; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .contact-box p{margin:0; color:var(--muted);}
  .email-link{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:15px;}

  footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:26px 0 40px;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:14px;
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;
  }

  @media (max-width:760px){
    .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .hero{padding:48px 0 56px;}
    .hero h1{font-size:33px;}
    nav a:not(.btn){display:none;}
    .endpoint{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:8px;}
    .contact-box{flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; padding:30px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="logo"><span class="dot">●</span>Adewumi Project</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#work">Work</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-solid">Get in touch</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <h1>I build the backend that doesn't fall over.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Backend engineer focused on APIs, databases, and authentication — the parts of a product that have to work correctly even when no one's watching.</p>
      <div class="ctas">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-solid">Start a project</a>
        <a href="#services" class="btn btn-ghost">See what I do</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="term" role="img" aria-label="Sample API response describing Adewumi Project">
      <div class="term-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <div class="term-body mono">
<span class="p">{</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="k">"name"</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="s">"Adewumi Project"</span><span class="p">,</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="k">"role"</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="s">"Backend Engineer"</span><span class="p">,</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="k">"focus"</span><span class="p">:</span> <span class="p">[</span><span class="s">"APIs"</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s">"databases"</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s">"auth"</span><span class="p">],</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="k">"status"</span><span class="p">:</span> 200<span class="p">,</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="k">"available"</span><span class="p">:</span> true<br>
<span class="p">}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>What I do</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">The core of the work, laid out the way I actually think about it.</p>

    <div class="endpoint">
      <span class="method m-post">POST</span>
      <div>
        <h3>/api/design</h3>
        <p>REST and GraphQL APIs designed around how the product is actually used, not just CRUD wrapped around a database.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="endpoint">
      <span class="method m-get">GET</span>
      <div>
        <h3>/database/schema</h3>
        <p>Schema design and query optimization for Postgres, MySQL, or MongoDB, so performance holds up as data grows.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="endpoint">
      <span class="method m-put">PUT</span>
      <div>
        <h3>/auth/secure</h3>
        <p>Authentication and authorization — JWT, OAuth2, role-based access — built in from the start, not bolted on later.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="endpoint">
      <span class="method m-post">POST</span>
      <div>
        <h3>/deploy</h3>
        <p>CI/CD pipelines and containerized deployments with Docker, so shipping is routine instead of a manual ritual.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="work">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>What I build</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Representative examples of the kind of backend systems I take on — happy to walk through the technical decisions behind any of them.</p>

    <div class="work-item">
      <h3>Marketplace order API</h3>
      <p>A REST API handling multi-vendor checkout, inventory sync, and payment webhooks for an e-commerce platform.</p>
      <div class="stack"><span>Node.js</span><span>Express</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Stripe API</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="work-item">
      <h3>Auth microservice</h3>
      <p>A standalone service for issuing, refreshing, and revoking tokens across multiple client applications.</p>
      <div class="stack"><span>Node.js</span><span>Redis</span><span>JWT</span><span>OAuth2</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="work-item">
      <h3>Real-time tracking API</h3>
      <p>A WebSocket-based API streaming live location and status updates for a delivery and logistics use case.</p>
      <div class="stack"><span>Node.js</span><span>Socket.io</span><span>MongoDB</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="contact-box">
      <div>
        <h2>Have an API to build?</h2>
        <p>Send a brief and I'll reply within a day.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:umaradewumi990@gmail.com" class="btn btn-solid email-link">umaradewumi990@gmail.com</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap" style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; width:100%; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;">
    <span>Adewumi Project — Backend Engineer</span>
    <span>© 2026</span>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
